{"type":"text","timestamp":"2026-09-30T21:51:40.648Z","data":{"text":"Task 4 is complete. Summary of what I did:\n\n**Source changes (all within scope):**\n- `next-step.ts`: `NextStepState` loses `verification-pending`; every archived change now returns `{ state: 'landed', command: null, detail: null }`; removed `readVerification` and `readArchivedNextStep`.\n- `queue-state.ts`: `QueueItemState` loses `verification-pending`; an archived association always derives as `landed`.\n- `queue-report-detail.ts`: `readQueueReportItem` treats only `landed` as an archived row.\n- `dependency-readiness.ts`: deleted `isVerificationPending`; every archived dependency is now met.\n- `status.ts`: `StatusOverview` loses `pendingVerifications`; `osq status` no longer prints `Verification pending:`.\n- `show.ts`: removed `readVerification`; verification history is built from the timeline and only included when it has rows; `afterLanding` comes from `parseHumanSteps` and prints after the `Verification:` place, indented two spaces.\n\n**Tests:**\n- New `tests/show-after-landing.test.ts` covering all seven required scenarios (task verify).\n- Updated `next-step`, `show-next-step`, and `verification-dependents` tests for landed behavior, no pending state, and archived dependencies counting as met.\n\n**Verification:** `node --import tsx --test tests/show-after-landing.test.ts` passes; `pnpm verify` passes (CLI + UI typechecks, build, full suite, lint).\n\nResult written to `openspec/changes/125-checks-osq-runs/.run/results/4.md`."}}
